option.SOLAS_BY_SEPTONIOUS.comment=Original author: Septonious (Solas Shader)\nDeveloper: Anatyi\nRepository: https://github.com/Anatyi/Solas-Shader-Classic\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/4uTAUQR2xu GitHub: https://github.com/Septonious/Solas-Shader\nChangelog:\n- Ported from 3.7: Lens Flare, DOF (manual focus), Vanilla Water, Double-layer Blocky Clouds, 3D End Portal\n- Enhanced: Vanilla Sun & Moon, Stars, Volumetric Light, Flare Style Presets, End Flare\n- Blocky Cloud Culling: layer occlusion modes (none / cull shadows / mutual culling)\n- End Revolution: black hole, stars and light direction revolve over time, glow & gravitational lensing\n- Per-dimension Lens Flare: independent Overworld / End / Nether switches, strength & coating style\n- Added Enhancements & Performance menus\n- Fixed: SSR reflections, Redstone puddle reflections, Fast Leaves

